# Listexteditor
===
 A cross-platform listening material editing and synthesis tool developed by the Yifang Operation and Maintenance Development Team. You can do listening if you know how to build building blocks. Compared with similar tools, it is more modern, visual, intelligent, autonomous and controllable. Support listening production in minor languages to meet the needs of the new college entrance examination. Supports Win/Mac/Linux (Xinchuang) three-terminal system. ..
